}}'''Candy Corn''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] gun that is currently obtainable in the [[Halloween Event 2025]] by collecting 1,600 '''[[Candies (2025)|Candies]]''' {{Currency|Candies2025}} and purchasing the 3rd tier or through trading.

== Appearance ==
This gun has a purple to pink gradient with Candy Corn scattered about. with an orange circle just above the handle. Some of the candy cane stickers appear to have faces that showcase different expressions while others have no face at all.
== Trivia ==

* It has a [[CandyCorn|partner knife]] under the same name.

